g leaps. \n\nRACE TO THE TOP: Compete against global players to clinch the fastest time.\n\nEVERY MOVE COUNTS: From skyscrapers to narrow ledges, precision is paramount. Your route choice and strategy can make or break your record.\n\nURBAN MASTERY: Delve deep into parkour; ascend massive structures, manoeuvre across slim rooftops, evade barriers, and launch into fearless leaps.\n\n5 UNIQUE LEVELS: Traverse diverse settings, from towering rooftops to bustling streets, each offering distinct parkour hurdles.\n\nWith high stakes and higher drops, it's not for the faint-hearted! Are you daring enough to dominate the urban jungle?\n", "short_description": "Climb the leaderboard in Freerunner Championship, a competitive VR parkour game that will push your skills to the limit! With heart-pounding action across 5 levels, scale towering walls, navigate treacherous rooftops, and execute death-defying leaps. With high stakes and higher drops, it's not for the faint-hearted! Are you daring enough to dominate the urban jungle?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.maze-theory.com/legal/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Maze Theory Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.maze-theory.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9932927900115661"}}